              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "terreō, terrēre — \"to frighten\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tonitrus īnfantem terruit. The thunder frightened the baby."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "terreō, terrēre, terruī, territum. English terrify and terror belong to this family."
            }
          ]
        },
